DOCUMENT();

loadMacros('PGstandard.pl', 'PGML.pl', 'PGcourse.pl');

Context('Interval');

$a = random(-9, 9,  2);
$b = random( 2, 14, 2);
$c = ($b**2) / 4;

$ans = Interval("(-Infinity,-$b/2) U (-$b/2,Infinity)");

BEGIN_PGML

Let 
[``` f(x) = \frac{x ? {[$a]}}{x^2 ? {[$b]} x ? {[$c]}}. ```]

Use interval notation to indicate the domain of [` f(x) `].

Domain = [_]{$ans}{30}

[@ helpLink('interval notation') @]*

END_PGML

ENDDOCUMENT();

